{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"おばんです〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ\nここ二日間ＰＶ撮影でした!!ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやぁ〜めちゃ体張った！うん!!\n筋肉痛ね!!\nまぁ寝たから大丈夫だけどね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/02/11/8224819/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんに早く語りたいけど、言えなかいからな〜\n待っててね〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして一実さんお誕生日おめでとうございます!!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/02/11/8224819/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/02/11/8224819/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/02/11/8224819/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/02/11/8224819/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/02/11/8224819/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/02/11/8224819/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/02/11/8224819/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/02/11/8224819/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/02/11/8224819/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/02/11/8224819/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/02/11/8224819/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/02/11/8224819/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなでお祝いしました！\n一実さんはいつもやさしい♪\nそして面白くてとっても美人さん♪美脚だしねっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結構遊びに行くのよっ〜\nいこまちゃんが新宿行きたいって言ったときは、いいよ〜って言ってつれてってくれて嬉しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/02/11/8224819/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ＭＩＬＫのお洋服にお互い憧れてていつもお話ししております♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもよろしくお願いいたします!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/02/11/8224819/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぼーいっしゅ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近髪の毛がのびてきたな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/02/11/8224819/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うさぎ欲しい♪\nもふもふっ!!\nいこまを癒してくれや〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/02/11/8224819/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あといこまは今ヴェノマニア公狂気という本を読んでますよん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悪ノＰさんの悪ノ娘シリーズ大好きですヽ(・∀・)ノ\n歌も素敵！物語も素敵！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ボカロは素晴らしいですね!!\n早く悪食娘コンチータも読みたいな〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやはやどっぷり浸っております♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の好きなものにふれるのは楽しすぎる♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ、そろそろ洗濯物たたみますかな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ!!"}],"source":"archive"}